<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F4.fig1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 3</span>. </span><span id="S4.F4.fig1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Distribution of Top-5 Access Control Policy
<br class="ltx_break">permissions across 296 MCP servers.</span><span id="acmlabel3-short" class="ltx_acm_description_short ltx_centering ltx_nodisplay">Top-5 <span id="acmlabel3-short.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">AgentManifest</span> permissions bar chart</span><span id="acmlabel3" class="ltx_acm_description ltx_centering ltx_nodisplay">Bar chart showing percentage prevalence of the top-5 permissions in \spec{} across \topmcpservercount{} MCP servers; categories include network.client, system.env.read, filesystem.read, filesystem.write, and network.server; y-axis in percent.</span></figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
